meta {
  name: Parties - Search
  type: http
  seq: 38
}

get {
  url: {{lego_data_service_base_url}}/api/v1/parties?name=smith
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  name: smith
  ~email: ann@example.com
  ~transactionPlatformName: Bricklink
  ~externalPartyId: annbricks
  ~limit: 50
}

docs {
  Finds parties (sellers, buyers, the owner) by any mix of the filters. Turn on the ones you need.

  - name: part of the first and last name, ignoring case.
  - email: part of the email, ignoring case.
  - transactionPlatformName + externalPartyId: the party's user name on a platform (Bricklink, eBay, ...).
  - limit: 1 to 200, default 50. With no filter, the first parties by id are returned.
}
